flowchart TD
    Start([Start Pharmacy Dispensing]) --> ReceiveRx[Receive Digital Prescription]
    ReceiveRx --> VerifySignature{Doctor Signature Valid?}
    VerifySignature -- No --> RejectRx[Reject Prescription] --> End([End Dispensing])
    VerifySignature -- Yes --> CheckStock{Stock Available?}
    CheckStock -- Partial/No --> TriggerLowStock[Trigger Low Stock Alert / Partial Pick] --> PickMeds
    CheckStock -- Yes --> PickMeds[Pick Prescribed Medication Items]
    PickMeds --> DecrementInv[Auto-Decrement Stock Quantities in Inventory]
    DecrementInv --> UpdateRxStatus[Update Prescription Status to Dispensed]
    UpdateRxStatus --> PostCharge[Post Pharmacy Charges to Billing]
    PostCharge --> HandoverMeds[Handover Medication & Print Usage Slip]
    HandoverMeds --> End
